<title>USA: Campo Electronics names Corley as president.</title>
<headline>Campo Electronics names Corley as president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campo Electronics, Appliances and Computers Inc said on Tuesday it named chief operating officer Rex Corley Jr. as president of the company.</p>
<p>Corley succeeds Anthony Campo as president, Campo said. Campo will continue as chairman and chief executive officer of the company, Campo said.</p>
<p>Wayne Usie, who was previously acting chief financial officer, was named chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
</text>
